;
; Pavise's trust tree in MYRA (pavise_rules.h PR7): each device on the
; signed roster (devmesh.devices), each app under it and each key under
; that app, a node whose value is whether it is trusted (1) or not (0)
; and since when, in seconds since 1970. Never a key's bytes: a key is
; its place on passkeys.list. The model asks whether the numbers fit
; before it keeps a node.
^ZXPAVISE(device:i4, app:i4, key:i4) = trust:i1! ^ since:i11!
